" parent="1" source="prom" target="alert"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e22" value="page" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="alert" target="oncall"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="flow" value="&lt;b&gt;Numbered request flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1  User opens the SPA over HTTPS&lt;br&gt;2  SPA calls the REST API with a JWT&lt;br&gt;3  Gateway routes to the API process&lt;br&gt;4  API commits deployment + audit + outbox + idempotency record in ONE SQL transaction&lt;br&gt;5  Worker claims the outbox row, records attempts, writes results with compare-and-swap&lt;br&gt;6  Worker calls the model runtime through the ModelRuntime port" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="740" width="200" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t" value="Legend" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="1410" width="80" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg0" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="1412" width="18" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lgt0" value="Client / UI" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="324" y="1411" width="140" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg1" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeom